# PocketBase Migrations

When you add or change files under `pocketbase/pb_migrations/`:

1. **Restart PocketBase yourself** — do not tell the user to restart manually.
2. Stop any running `pocketbase.exe` on port `8090`, then run migrations and serve:

```powershell
Get-Process pocketbase -ErrorAction SilentlyContinue | Stop-Process -Force
cd F:\Projects\Hoomban\pocketbase
.\pocketbase.exe migrate
.\pocketbase.exe serve --http=127.0.0.1:8090
```

3. Run the serve command in the background and confirm `http://127.0.0.1:8090/api/health` responds.
4. Only mention restart to the user if the command fails and you cannot recover.
